            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/polar-bear.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/polar-bear.html",
            "title": "Fearless",
            "summary": "｜無所畏懼・Fearless｜ 人生就是要無所畏懼，勇往直前，才能看見不一樣的風光！ 獅首龍身，乘浪而行。奇獸躍於巨浪之巔，象徵無畏與堅定意志。以自製化妝土、粉引與四種釉藥交疊，雕塑變幻莫測的浪花，凝鍊出勇往直前的力量與信念。 Life is about being fearless and moving forward—only then&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜無所畏懼・Fearless｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">人生就是要無所畏懼，勇往直前，才能看見不一樣的風光！</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">獅首龍身，乘浪而行。奇獸躍於巨浪之巔，象徵無畏與堅定意志。以自製化妝土、粉引與四種釉藥交疊，雕塑變幻莫測的浪花，凝鍊出勇往直前的力量與信念。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\"> </p>\n<p class=\"p3\">Life is about being fearless and moving forward—only then can we see a different landscape.</p>\n<p>With the head of a lion and the body of a dragon, the mythical creature rides the waves, symbolizing courage and unwavering will. Using self-made slip, white slip coating, and four layered glazes, the work captures the ever-changing form of the sea, distilling the strength and conviction to charge ahead without fear.</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  style=\"font-size: inherit; outline: rgba(13, 139, 242, 0.55) solid 3px !important;\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_05-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"1280\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_05-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_05-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_05-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_05-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_03_s01-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"1280\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_03_s01-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_03_s01-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_03_s01-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/3/responsive/Wu-Suo-Wei-Ju-Yong-Wang-Zhi-Qian_03_s01-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\"></figure>\n<p> </p>",
