            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/norway.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/norway.html",
            "title": "Hare with straight flush",
            "summary": "｜握著同花順的野兔・Hare with straight flush｜ 野兔翹腳而坐，身穿淺灰藍帽T，右手持青花繪製的撲克牌，牌面是一副完美的同花順。這看似幸運的場景，卻不張揚勝利，反而透露一種冷靜與自省。作品寓意深遠——真正決定人生質地的，不是是否含著金湯匙出生，而是你是否懂得運用所擁有的一切，以智慧行動、沉著應對。這隻野兔，是每個在混亂中堅持思考的人，是一則關於命運與選擇的寓言。 A hare, dressed in a soft gray-blue&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜握著同花順的野兔・Hare with straight flush｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">野兔翹腳而坐，身穿淺灰藍帽<span class=\"s1\">T</span>，右手持青花繪製的撲克牌，牌面是一副完美的同花順。這看似幸運的場景，卻不張揚勝利，反而透露一種冷靜與自省。作品寓意深遠<span class=\"s1\">——</span>真正決定人生質地的，不是是否含著金湯匙出生，而是你是否懂得運用所擁有的一切，以智慧行動、沉著應對。這隻野兔，是每個在混亂中堅持思考的人，是一則關於命運與選擇的寓言。<span class=\"s2\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 align-left\">A hare, dressed in a soft gray-blue hoodie, sits cross-legged, quietly holding a set of a perfect royal flush. Yet the scene isn’t one of celebration, but of calm reflection. This piece speaks to a deeper truth: life isn’t defined by privilege or luck, but by how we use what we’re given. The hare becomes an allegory for clarity, choice, and quiet strength in the face of chance. It is a story of wisdom over circumstance.</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_02_Back-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"825\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_02_Back-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_02_Back-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_02_Back-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_02_Back-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_05_Cards-Da-2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"825\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_05_Cards-Da-2-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_05_Cards-Da-2-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_05_Cards-Da-2-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/2/responsive/B_1100x825_150dpi_Wo-Zhu-Tong-Hua-Shun-De-Ye-Tu_05_Cards-Da-2-lg.jpeg 1024w\"></figure>\n<p> </p>",
